set_option autoImplicit false
-- FG circuit pilot S2s: port of Tools.ShippingChildCacheA onto the context-predicate bundles (RefLawsAOpsX / RefLawsATeleX); generated by a rename-only script (names + suffix X, `AdmCtx O.quiet` -> `O.adm`). No sorry/axiom/native_decide/TRUSTED/law.

/-! # The child cache under the admissible boundary

Witness: `O : RefLawsAOpsX Fresh mref cref` (the restricted operations laws)
at an admissible context `hA : O.adm mctx cctx`. The old cache half
(`RealChild`/`CacheInv`/`CacheAt`, ShippingChildInv.lean:444-500) quantified
its quietness over an existential old law witness and its cache over every read; here:

* `RealChildAX O c r`: `r` is returned by a run of the real entry
  `synthesizeCombinational c` in an ADMISSIBLE context, from a world that is
  quiet for the FIXED witness (`O.quiet w`), whose synthesis ref holds
  `synthesizeChild` (`sv w`), and whose cache VALUE `cv w` has `RealChildAX`
  entries only;
* `CacheInvAX O m`: every entry of `m` is a `RealChildAX`;
* `JQCX O D w := JQ O.quiet D w ∧ CacheInvAX O (cv w)`: the vertical
  invariant with its cache half.

Proved:
* `stableA_JQCX`: `JQCX` is stable — every `FramedA`/diag step keeps it
  (`keepsC_framedX`, `keepsC_diagX`, through `keepsA_framedX`/`keepsA_diagX`);
* the depth-0 clear establishes it from `JQ` (`tripleC_clearX`, `O.cacheSet`:
  the cache value becomes `{}`), the depth set/modify move it
  (`tripleC_depthSetX`, `tripleC_depthModifyX`), the child insert keeps it when
  the inserted entry is a `RealChildAX` (`tripleC_insertX`, `jqc_insert_runsX`:
  `RefLawsAOpsX.cacheModify'` = read;write);
* `jqc_cacheGetX`: the cache read returns `cv w` (`O.frame` at
  `FramedA.cacheGet` + `runsTo_get_readOf`);
* **`synthesizeChild_realAX`**: every returning run of `synthesizeChild n`
  from a `JQCX O D` world returns a `RealChildAX O n` result and ends in
  `JQCX O D` — on a cache HIT the returned value is the cached entry, a
  `RealChildAX` by the cache half; on a MISS the nested run starts in a `JQCX`
  world (so its result is a `RealChildAX`, `RealChildAX.of_jqcX`) and, by the
  premise `hentry`, ends in one, and the insert keeps `JQCX`;
  `synthesizeChild_tripleCX`: the same as a triple on every outcome;
* **`closeInstsM_realAX`** (endpoint): a returning run of the one-output
  closing `closeInstsM` from a `JQCX` world closes with children that are,
  call by call, `RealChildAX`s of the call's declaration — cache hits included —
  and ends in `JQCX`. -/

namespace Tools.ShippingChildCacheA
open Lean Meta
